    {
      "heading": "Introduction to Machine Learning",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "text": "Machine learning teaches computers to learn from data.",
          "timestamp": "00:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "It contrasts with giving computers explicit rules.",
          "timestamp": "00:00"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Supervised Learning",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "text": "System is trained on labeled data (e.g., spam/not spam).",
          "timestamp": "00:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "Model learns patterns to predict unseen cases.",
          "timestamp": "00:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "Common algorithms include decision trees, SVMs, and neural networks.",
          "timestamp": "00:00"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Unsupervised Learning",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "text": "System finds patterns in data without labels.",
          "timestamp": "00:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "Example: clustering customers based on purchasing behavior.",
          "timestamp": "00:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "K-means is a classic algorithm.",
          "timestamp": "00:00"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Reinforcement Learning",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "text": "An agent interacts with an environment.",
          "timestamp": "00:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "Learns from feedback or rewards.",
          "timestamp": "00:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "Examples: training AI for video games or robot control.",
          "timestamp": "00:00"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Challenges in Machine Learning",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "text": "Overfitting: model memorizes training data, performs poorly on new data.",
          "timestamp": "01:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "Bias: occurs when the training data itself is unbalanced.",
          "timestamp": "01:00"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Applications of Machine Learning",
      "bullets": [
        {
          "text": "Healthcare: disease prediction.",
          "timestamp": "01:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "Finance: fraud detection.",
          "timestamp": "01:00"
        },
        {
          "text": "Self-driving cars: object recognition.",
          "timestamp": "01:00"
        }
      ]
    },
